 488:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h **** /**
 489:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * Mix two colors with a given ratio. It runs faster then `lv_color_mix` but requires some pre comp
 490:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param premult_c1 The first color. Should be preprocessed with `lv_color_premult(c1)`
 491:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param c2 The second color. As it is no pre computation required on it
 492:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param mix The ratio of the colors. 0: full `c1`, 255: full `c2`, 127: half `c1` and half `c2`.
 493:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  *            Should be modified like mix = `255 - mix`
 494:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @return the mixed color
 495:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @note 255 won't give clearly `c1`.
 496:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  */
